Z||000035||avengador1||11-26-2001||07:51 PM||||I originally bought the Fiero to turn it into a Lambo or Ferrari kit car, but I liked the looks so much I decided to keep it just the way it is. I already have about 10K into the car(including purchase price). All of this was to get it up to what I consider a safe working condition. All I have left to do is a new paint job, poly bushings all around, maybe a new steering rack(or rebuild old one), put scoop on decklid, and replace the headliner. And if Triad ever finishes his supercharger kit, maybe I'll do that too. I don't do things to be cool, I do them because I want to and can afford it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by avengador1 (edited 11-26-2001).]||||reg||1
